<h2><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Introduction">Introduction</span></h2=
>
<p>Question themes can be used to customize existing question types and cha=
nge their visual appearance. Question themes can only be built on core <b>Q=
uestion types</b>.
</p>
<h2><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Access">Access</span></h2>
<p>To access the question themes, go to Configuration &gt; Themes &gt; Ques=
tion themes.
</p><p><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https:=
//www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:QuestionThemes1Overview.png" class=3D"mw-f=
ile-description"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/a/a4/=
QuestionThemes1Overview.png" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"867" height=3D"285=
" class=3D"mw-file-element"></a></span>
</p><p><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https:=
//www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:QuestionThemes1O.1verview.png" class=3D"mw=
-file-description"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/4/4=
f/QuestionThemes1O.1verview.png" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"1036" height=
=3D"408" class=3D"mw-file-element"></a></span>
</p><p><br>
Here you can visualize both question types, core question themes, and user =
question themes.
</p><p><br>
<span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https://www.l=
imesurvey.org/manual/File:QuestionThemes2Overview.png" class=3D"mw-file-des=
cription"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/4/48/Questio=
nThemes2Overview.png" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"1801" height=3D"406" clas=
s=3D"mw-file-element"></a></span>
</p>
<h2><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Visibility">Visibility</span></h2>
<p>Question Themes are by default visible, but can be switched off. Once tu=
rned off, <b>they will no longer be displayed inside the question type sele=
ctor</b>.
</p><p><br>
<b>Configuration</b> &gt; <b>Themes</b> &gt; <b>Question Themes</b> &gt; <b=
>Visibility</b>
</p><p><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https:=
//www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:QuestionThemes3.1Visibility.png" class=3D"=
mw-file-description"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/1=
/1e/QuestionThemes3.1Visibility.png" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"1778" heig=
ht=3D"452" class=3D"mw-file-element"></a></span>
</p><p><br>
The following screenshots of the <b>question type selector</b> shows the vi=
sibility of the Array 5-point question "On" (left) and "Off" (right)
</p><p><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https:=
//www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:QuestionThemes3.2Visibility.png" class=3D"=
mw-file-description"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/4=
/46/QuestionThemes3.2Visibility.png" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"853" heigh=
t=3D"754" class=3D"mw-file-element"></a></span>
</p><p><br>
When the Option "<a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/index.php?tit=
le=3DQuestion_Themes&amp;action=3Dedit&amp;redlink=3D1" class=3D"new" title=
=3D"Question Themes (page does not exist)">Show as question type</a>" is en=
abled, all question themes will also be displayed inside the question type =
selector.
</p>
<h2><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Uninstall_and_available_question_them=
es">Uninstall and available question themes</span></h2>
<p>All available themes will be displayed in this section.
</p><p>If you want to uninstall a question theme, you can do so by selectin=
g the question Theme and choosing "Uninstall" inside the dropdown menu unde=
r the table. They will now appear inside the available Question Themes tabl=
e.
</p><p>If a theme is uninstalled, it will no longer be available inside the=
 question type selector.
</p><p><br>
Steps to uninstall a question theme:
</p><p>1. <b>Configuration</b> &gt; <b>Themes</b> &gt; <b>Question themes</=
b>
</p><p>2. Tick the box for the question theme that you would like to uninst=
all.
</p><p>3. Click on "Selected themes" at the bottom of the page and select "=
Uninstall" from the dropdown options.
</p>
<b><div class=3D"simplebox"><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:Fi=
le"><a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/File:Help.png" class=3D"mw=
-file-description"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/a/a=
a/Help.png" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"25" height=3D"25" class=3D"mw-file-=
element"></a></span>Question themes cannot be uninstalled if they are still=
 used inside a aurvey.</div></b>
<p><br>
<span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:File"><a href=3D"https://www.l=
imesurvey.org/manual/File:QuestionThemes5AvailableQuestions.png" class=3D"m=
w-file-description"><img src=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/images/8/=
86/QuestionThemes5AvailableQuestions.png" decoding=3D"async" width=3D"614" =
height=3D"769" class=3D"mw-file-element"></a></span>
</p>
<h2><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Broken_question_themes">Broken questi=
on themes</span></h2>
<p>If there are errors while loading the <a href=3D"https://www.limesurvey.=
org/manual/index.php?title=3DQuestion_Themes&amp;action=3Dedit&amp;redlink=
=3D1" class=3D"new" title=3D"Question Themes (page does not exist)">availab=
le question themes</a>, they will be displayed in this category with an err=
or message.
</p>
<h2><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Importing_question_theme">Importing q=
uestion theme</span></h2>
<p>It is possible to import Question Themes using the import button. During=
 the import, the theme will be automatically installed and available for us=
e.
</p><p>When a theme is imported from LS3 or above, it will be automatically=
 converted into the current standard.
</p><p>The imported Theme must be in the <b>ZIP</b> format.
</p><p>Before compressing the folder to zip, it must have the following str=
ucture:
</p><p><span class=3D"mw-default-size" typeof=3D"mw:Error mw:File"><a href=
=3D"https://www.limesurvey.org/manual/index.php?title=3DSpecial:Upload&amp;=
wpDestFile=3DQuestionThemes6ImportStructure.png" class=3D"new" title=3D"Fil=
e:QuestionThemes6ImportStructure.png"><span class=3D"mw-file-element mw-bro=
ken-media">File:QuestionThemes6ImportStructure.png</span></a></span>
</p><p>NAME/survey/questions/answer/QUESTIONTYPENAME/config.xml
</p>
