<h2><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Configuration">Configuration</span></=
h2>
<p>The configuration of a question theme can be found inside config.xml.
</p><p>An example can be found in the <a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"nofollow =
noreferrer noopener" class=3D"external text" href=3D"https://github.com/Lim=
eSurvey/LimeSurvey/tree/develop/docs/themes">docs folder</a>.
</p>
<h3><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Metadata">Metadata</span></h3>
